    engine2d_fresh_device_preflight_rejects_themed_wm_chrome_2026-11-26, 0, "engine2d_draw_ir_adv_fresh_device_composition_with_images rejects the themed WM chrome stream (fluid_light and aetheric_dark snapshots) with fresh-device-command-preflight-required on NVIDIA GB10 and llvmpipe; only the no-package plain stream reaches device_readback. Production bootstraps always install a theme, and simpleos_gpu_host daemon_runner uses this path."

