    engine2d_fresh_device_preflight_rejects_themed_wm_chrome_2026-11-26, 0, "2026-11-26 wm-lane-20261126 Linux aarch64 seed cargo-target-wr-seed1126b: themed example device arm red (preflight_rejected, skipped=1) on NVIDIA GB10 and llvmpipe; plain stream device_readback with pixels equal to CPU on both. Themed CPU composition also paints no window shadow despite snapshot shadow layers."
